          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-navy-900 mb-3">Check your car's value in 30 seconds</h3>
          <p class="text-graphite mb-4">Free, no signup, no phone number, no dealer calls. Get a fair-price band backed by real transaction data.</p>
